{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Reserve time for invocation finalization.** Leaving only 50 ms can consume nearly all remaining Lambda time before `onInvocationEnd`; the bundled OTel plugins may then spend up to five seconds flushing. A blocked handler near timeout can therefore turn the intended PENDING/RETRYING response into a Lambda timeout. Calculate the handoff budget from an invocation deadline that reserves sufficient plugin-finalization and response time, and cover a low-remaining-time case.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc74o8NZ","finding_digest":"b78727353d5aca25c4775a25cb6560c3422566901dd25985b99b638626898b56","finding_id":"arf_v1_w6dsonj5llfclrdxlis4wzlayn","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::finalization-time-budget","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::finalization-time-budget","line":223,"observation_digest":"49a0baddccfca76a057b8fa91775f3abda71c580d26a63bc5fe0e58dc8cac479","observation_id":"aro_v1_jgqlvxom7stwubl3r6uro5ptvp","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-03T03:13:31Z","review_id":"arr_v1_535xlid3vgtfbr4dah35k6itzj","reviewed_base_sha":"61f5d103651c2bafc54f840a539cf55a95f47df7","reviewed_head_sha":"95ed86d294b31a1fc987850928cc35e507d1a900","reviewer":"codex","start_line":223,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_zsgrwagambzh6ttgrossdzuymz","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-03T03:13:31Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
